1. Scope
   This license covers the entire contents of this repository, including the
   source code, project structure, visual design, page layouts, styles,
   scripts, games, content, recipes, photographs, logo and other brand assets
   (the "Project").

2. Permitted use
   The Project is made publicly available for portfolio purposes only. You may
   only view the Project on the platform where it is published (e.g. GitHub)
   in order to review it.

3. Prohibited use
   Without the copyright holder's prior written permission, you may not,
   in particular:
   a) copy or reproduce the Project, in whole or in part, including
      downloading it for further use;
   b) distribute, publish, share, sell, lend or sublicense the Project;
   c) modify the Project or create derivative works based on it, including
      using it as a template or starting point for other websites or
      applications;
   d) run or deploy the Project, or any part of it, on any server, hosting
      service or other public environment;
   e) use the Project for any commercial or non-commercial purpose;
   f) remove or alter any copyright notice or this license;
   g) use the Project to train, fine-tune or evaluate artificial intelligence
      or machine learning models.

4. Brand assets and content
   The "Bezglutenowa Karola" name, logo, photographs, texts, recipes and other
   brand assets belong to Karolina Wontorska-Godlewska and may not be used
   without permission, regardless of the terms of this license.

5. Platform terms of service
   Where the terms of service of the platform hosting the Project (e.g. GitHub)
   grant users certain rights (such as viewing or forking within the
   platform), those rights are limited strictly to the scope required by those
   terms and grant no other rights to the Project.

6. Third-party materials
   Third-party libraries and tools used by the Project (listed in
