7. No warranty
   The Project is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The
   copyright holder is not liable for any damages arising from its use.

8. Infringement
   Any use of the Project beyond section 2 constitutes copyright infringement
   under the Polish Act of 4 February 1994 on Copyright and Related Rights and
